    },
    {
      "id": "claim_03fe927a2fdf436fbb739f6e2dfb6a8b",
      "statement": "Agent memory is stored as a row in the claude_memory table and materialized to disk per scope: 'local' writes .claude/CLAUDE.md inside the user's workspace while 'user' writes ~/.claude/CLAUDE.md, and a missing row writes an empty file so the file always reflects current database state.",
