      "id": "claim_c641f0b733b44b658b17d5895ec0bd84",
      "statement": "Each user's extension state is confined to a workspace directory at ${USER_WORKSPACES_DIR}/{user_id} which is passed to the SDK as cwd, making the agent's working directory the filesystem tenant boundary.",
