    {
      "id": "claim_cfcda09d07734930aa98316afc143d8f",
      "statement": "The system prompt is passed as a preset with an append rather than a bare string, because a bare string replaces the Claude Code preset and silently removes the built-in Read, Write, Bash and Grep tools, leaving only MCP tools.",
