    {
      "id": "claim_c51cdb9ee45c4f448c3351a1d3ea3dcd",
      "statement": "Workspace preparation failures are logged and swallowed rather than raised, so a session still runs without a cwd — the agent simply cannot see the user's synced skills and memory.",
